<title>USA: Esterline Q3 net off,year-ago includes gains.</title>
<headline>Esterline Q3 net off,year-ago includes gains.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ESTERLINE TECHNOLOGIES</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 7/31     9 Mos ended 7/31</p>
<p>				1996     1995	     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		$81,729 $87,318	 $254,701 $255,462</p>
<p>   Cost of sales	 49,524  52,984	  153,392  156,141</p>
<p>   SG&amp;A		    24,264  25,483	   77,805   80,256</p>
<p>Restructuring</p>
<p>    provision (credit)     --  (2,067)		--  (2,067)</p>
<p>   Interest income	(772)   (260)	  (1,636)    (952)</p>
<p>   Interest expense     1,116   1,241	    3,431    4,423</p>
<p>			     74,132  77,381	  232,992  237,801</p>
<p> Earnings before taxes  7,597   9,937	   21,709   17,661</p>
<p> Income tax expense     2,569   3,348	    7,137    5,823</p>
<p> Net earnings	     5,028   6,589	   14,572   11,838</p>
<p> Net EPS			.58     .93	     1.82     1.70</p>
<p> Number of shares*	8,724   7,066	    8,001    6,982</p>
<p>		(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 net earnings per share of $0.93 include $0.61 per share from normal operations, $0.20 per share from the favorable conclusion of 1993 restructuring, and $0.12 a share from one-time operating income related to the settlement of a patent infringement.</p>
<p>1996 quarter and year-to-date number of shares reflect 1.8 million shares issued as a result of a public stock offering.</p>
